# This repo uses a separate .env per service, not one root .env.
# Copy each service's own example before first deploy:
#
#   core/pihole/.env.example      -> core/pihole/.env
#   apps/minecraft/.env.example   -> apps/minecraft/.env       (CF_API_KEY)
#   core/cloudflare-ddns/.env.example -> core/cloudflare-ddns/.env  (CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN)
#
# See README.md for the full setup order.
